WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:14.170
<b>300 enemy soldiers fell in the battle for the town.</b>

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.990
<b>The ones who escaped pursuit are sure to have rejoined their main army.</b>

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:21.250
<b>The enemy forces are likely reorganizing as we speak.</b>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.960
<b>What about their commander?</b>

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.380
<b>Unfortunately, he got away from us.</b>

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:34.800
<b>What's done is done.</b>

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:38.390
<b>If the initial reports about their numbers are correct,</b>

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:40.680
<b>Thenardier should have 2700 soldiers left.</b>

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.950
<b>We will leave 100 men
behind to protect the town,</b>

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:46.490
<b>reducing our fighting force from 1000 to 900.</b>

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.820
<b>Which means they still outnumber us three-to-one.</b>

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:53.360
<b>Where do you think the enemy will flee?</b>

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.240
<b>Probably here.</b>

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:00.580
<b>To the Molsheim Plains. 
It's where they can use their cavalry best.</b>

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.910
<b>Got it. That's where we'll hit them.</b>

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:05.830
<b>We'll give them everything...</b>

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:07.560
<b>...they deserve and more.</b>

