00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.100
<b>Did you say Zhcted?!</b>

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:54.360
<b>Impossible! Why'd they have soldiers there?!</b>

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:02.910
<b>Vorn...!</b>

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.880
<b>That's it. He brought them.</b>

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:08.000
<b>This is all his fault!</b>

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.540
<b>Damn it! How dare that useless bowman...</b>

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:15.590
<b>Send more scouts!</b>

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:18.510
<b>And make sure they don't get back here without the enemy's numbers!</b>

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:19.260
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:24.180
<b>I'm sure he's the one who led
Zhcted soldiers into our country.</b>

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:27.180
<b>That traitor! That cowardly rat!</b>

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:38.280
<b>Just you watch! I'll show you!</b>

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:50.500
<b>Zion split up his remaining men into three groups.</b>

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:56.320
<b>The first consisted of seven hundred infantrymen armed with bows and spears.</b>

00:03:56.320 --> 00:04:01.820
<b>The second one was a heavy cavalry unit wearing hardened steel armor and carrying lances.</b>

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:05.220
<b>The remaining thousand soldiers made up the main force.</b>

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:07.640
<b>Zion was following a traditional Brunish battle plan</b>

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:10.060
<b>for fighting on grassy plains.</b>

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.850
<b>The only things special were...</b>

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.150
<b>the two dragons.</b>

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.280
<b>We can double up the thin ropes!</b>

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.200
<b>Contribute to the war effort! Everything helps!</b>

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:28.830
<b>Good luck!</b>

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:30.750
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.830
<b>Anything for Lord Tigre.</b>

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.000
<b>Yes, yes.</b>

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.710
<b>We need him to stick it to those Thenardier guys.</b>

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.800
<b>This is about all we can do to help.</b>

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.430
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.810
<b>Tigre and I will take four hundred men with us.</b>

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.810
<b>Lim, you'll be in charge of the rest.</b>

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.730
<b>Wait for an opening, and then let them have it.</b>

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.070
<b>Do you have any ideas?</b>

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.200
<b>I could use some rope.</b>

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:10.450
<b>We can double up anything too fine. We need as much as possible.</b>

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:11.740
<b>Rope, huh?</b>

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.390
<b>Please let me take care of that!</b>

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.580
<b>Titta...</b>

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.960
<b>I'll ask the townspeople.</b>

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.260
<b>Please let me handle it.</b>

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.840
<b>Thanks, Titta.</b>

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.560
<b>U-Um...</b>

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.350
<b>How are you...</b>

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:47.910
<b>How are you and Lord Tigre connected to each other?!</b>

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:52.580
<b>He belongs to me.</b>

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.660
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.450
<b>Well, she's right.</b>

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:58.000
<b>For the time being, I'm her prisoner.</b>

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.330
<b>Oh, no, not just for the time being.</b>

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:03.070
<b>According to the treaty we have with Brune, you belong to me.</b>

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:04.710
<b>Well, even so,</b>

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:07.760
<b>we should focus on defeating the enemy before us first of—</b>

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:09.220
<b>I'm not giving up on him!</b>

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:17.770
<b>She won't give up, will she?</b>

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.270
<b>Lady Eleonora...</b>

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.110
<b>I know.</b>

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.900
<b>By the way, what do you have in mind for the spare horses?</b>

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:26.530
<b>Spare horses?</b>

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.530
<b>We were going to leave them behind here in Celesta.</b>

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.410
<b>Do you have a problem with that?</b>

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.040
<b>I just thought of something.</b>

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:40.170
<b>He occasionally does have some interesting ideas.</b>

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.500
<b>Young Lord!</b>

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.710
<b>Oh, you're here!</b>

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.010
<b>Hey, now...</b>

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.640
<b>I won't be able to fight carrying all this, will I?</b>

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.930
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:58.350
<b>As long as you stay behind Elen and me, you won't have to.</b>

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:59.520
<b>Isn't that right?</b>

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:00.310
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.020
<b>Of course, I won't let them get close to <i>you</i>, either.</b>

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:04.860
<b>You'll be perfectly safe with me.</b>

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:11.200
<b>Time and again the formation
Thenardier is using proved infallible.</b>

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:16.330
<b>To counter it, the Zhcted army positions four hundred cavalrymen to face the foe head-on.</b>

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.660
<b>At their vanguard stand Elen and Tigre.</b>

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:24.920
<b>The two armies are about to march
on each other, their fight imminent.</b>

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:31.470
<b>Are you scared?</b>

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:33.510
<b>I am.</b>

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.140
<b>But I have a feeling I won't lose.</b>

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:37.930
<b>What a coincidence.</b>

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.100
<b>So have I.</b>

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.490
<b>Charge!</b>

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.160
<b>Arifar!</b>

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.850
<b>Your skill with the bow really is out of this world.</b>

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:22.810
<b>That's tall coming from
someone with your powers.</b>

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:26.020
<b>Don't take it the wrong way. 
It was a compliment.</b>

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:42.540
<b>That's the Wind Princess of the Silver Flash and Danseuse of the Sword for you.</b>

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.120
<b>We can't let her hog all the glory, Bertrand!</b>

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:47.880
<b>Aye!</b>

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:53.300
<b>Keep going!</b>

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.320
<b>Payback for the Battle of Dinant!</b>

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:11.320
<b>Young Lord!</b>

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:34.720
<b>A dragon!</b>

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:35.520
<b>It's a dragon!</b>

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:36.800
<b>A land dragon.</b>

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.220
<b>A brass-colored one...</b>

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.260
<b>They actually tamed a dragon? Not bad.</b>

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:45.730
<b>The Thenardier army sends their dragon straight at the enemy</b>

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:47.850
<b>while attacking the flanks with cavalry.</b>

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:51.360
<b>The Zhcted forces are unable to move past the dragon,</b>

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:54.110
<b>and the plain is about to overflow with their blood and bodies.</b>

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.370
<b>It's too hard!</b>

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:11.130
<b>Die! Die now, Vorn!</b>

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:14.590
<b>Be trampled by the dragon! 
Torn apart by its claws!</b>

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.840
<b>It's what you deserve, traitorous swine!</b>

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.640
<b>Enemy ambush! They're attacking the second column's flank!</b>

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.510
<b>What?</b>

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.640
<b>Again with the cheap tricks? Same as at Dinant?</b>

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:26.980
<b>Send four hundred men from the flying column!</b>

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.610
<b>Charge!</b>

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.030
<b>I've been waiting for this moment!</b>

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:40.660
<b>An independent troop of four hundred cavalrymen led by Lim,</b>

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.700
<b>strikes at Thenardier's flanking unit.</b>

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.660
<b>With the enemy's advance halted,</b>

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:48.660
<b>Elen moves to challenge the land dragon at once.</b>

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:01.050
<b>I wasn't expecting a dragon.</b>

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:04.180
<b>As a reward for surprising me, 
I'll show you a somewhat fancy move.</b>

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.180
<b>Elen?</b>

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:35.210
<b>Tear asunder the air and all who stand in my path!</b>

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:43.140
<b>Ley Admos!</b>

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:14.460
<b>Now it's time for our counterattack.</b>

