00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.020
<b>What was that just now?</b>

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.810
<b>I've never seen that technique before!</b>

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.230
<b>Naturally.</b>

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.020
<b>Because I've never used it in front of others.</b>

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:40.360
<b>It's too powerful, so I don't use it against humans.</b>

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:42.530
<b>Ley Admos...</b>

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:45.860
<b>The enemy is sending soldiers from their flying column.</b>

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:46.740
<b>They're coming?</b>

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.370
<b>We're pulling back, exactly as planned.</b>

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.370
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:53.410
<b>Zion split off four hundred cavalrymen from his main force,</b>

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.370
<b>forming a flying column.</b>

00:12:55.370 --> 00:13:00.340
<b>Without putting up a fight, 
Lim's unit retreats to the hills.</b>

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:01.880
<b>The enemy is fleeing!</b>

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:03.590
<b>Those fools!</b>

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.130
<b>Let's make a name for ourselves.</b>

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:18.810
<b>Now!</b>

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:29.700
<b>You've only been looking ahead, at the enemy, 
and that is why you tripped.</b>

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:33.700
<b>No matter how much the townsfolk hate Thenardier,</b>

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.710
<b>they wouldn't have given <i>us</i> this much rope.</b>

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:41.170
<b>Sir Tigrevurmud really is loved by his people, isn't he?</b>

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.300
<b>And there's one more thing...</b>

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:55.180
<b>It's just about time, huh?</b>

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:55.980
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:58.650
<b>Time for the ambush.</b>

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:04.400
<b>An enemy regiment is
approaching from the rear!</b>

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:07.160
<b>Their forces are a full... two thousand!</b>

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.320
<b>Two thousand?!</b>

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:11.410
<b>We've only got six hundred men in our headquarters!</b>

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.450
<b>They've got over three times as many!
 Coming from behind us...?!</b>

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:17.040
<b>Lord Zion, let's send out the winged dragon.</b>

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.080
<b>The winged dragon...?</b>

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:20.960
<b>You idiot!</b>

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:22.840
<b>The enemy already slaughtered our other dragon!</b>

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.500
<b>It was cleaved in half!</b>

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.590
<b>What if they do this one in, too?!</b>

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:31.350
<b><i>I'll</i> be blamed for losing them, not <i>you</i>!</b>

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:44.270
<b>Think, Zion Thenardier!</b>

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:46.240
<b>You're the commander here!</b>

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:48.820
<b>What is most important right now...</b>

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.240
<b>That's it! My own life!</b>

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.740
<b>Call the second column back! 
We're retreating!</b>

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:59.920
<b>Lord Zion, we can tough it out.</b>

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:04.130
<b>If the knights can hold their ground until
they've destroyed the enemy ahead, we'll—</b>

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:04.840
<b>Shut up!</b>

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:07.260
<b>Ow!</b>

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.260
<b>Lord Zion...</b>

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:13.720
<b>Get the knights to stand down immediately!</b>

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:14.760
<b>Do it now!</b>

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:17.770
<b>Zion fails to realize—</b>

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.770
<b>no, he couldn't have realized</b>

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:25.070
<b>that less than a hundred soldiers were attacking from behind.</b>

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.610
<b>However, they brought two thousand spare horses with them.</b>

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:32.780
<b>Tigre took advantage of the terrain and the setting sun to make them look like a huge army.</b>

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.530
<b>Retreat, you say?!</b>

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:37.540
<b>We've almost won. What are they thinking?!</b>

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.460
<b>Apparently a huge enemy army is attacking our rear.</b>

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:43.290
<b>It's a direct order from Lord Zion.</b>

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.130
<b>That damn fool!</b>

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:50.170
<b>The knights serving House Thenardier</b>

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.640
<b>could not refuse an order.</b>

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:57.260
<b>As they retreat, the battle enters its next phase.</b>

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:08.230
<b>They've broken through the second cavalry column!</b>

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.990
<b>The main force is being pushed back too!</b>

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.660
<b>We need reinforcements! We need the dragon!</b>

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:20.560
<b>No, this isn't what I had in mind!</b>

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:22.380
<b>There's no way that he—</b>

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:24.920
<b>that someone like Vorn could defeat me!</b>

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.300
<b>Vorn!</b>

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:38.060
<b>It's too late to run away, Zion Thenardier!</b>

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.770
<b>Run away?</b>

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:41.560
<b>Ridiculous!</b>

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:46.230
<b>You betray our country and bring Zhcted forces onto our land?!</b>

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:50.530
<b>Your ancestors were common huntsmen!
 You can't escape your blood!</b>

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.530
<b>Don't you realize this is all your own fault?</b>

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:53.780
<b>What?</b>

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.740
<b>You made innocent villagers suffer,</b>

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.280
<b>burned their houses, and stole their property.</b>

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.290
<b>You're the spitting image of a brigand!</b>

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:03.710
<b>Huh? The commoners?</b>

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.040
<b>What about them?!</b>

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:09.040
<b>They're the same as plants. 
Cut them down and they grow back in time!</b>

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.840
<b>Why would you care about them?</b>

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.970
<b>He's quite the lowlife, huh?</b>

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.800
<b>I can't possibly understand how you think.</b>

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:20.560
<b>But I do know that I'll make you pay for plundering my land</b>

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.310
<b>and tormenting my people!</b>

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:26.190
<b>You've got some nerve!</b>

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.190
<b>I challenge you to a duel, Vorn!</b>

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:34.490
<b>You attacked me!</b>

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.070
<b>Don't you dare run away now!</b>

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.120
<b>Has he lost it?</b>

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:41.580
<b>Wait, are you...</b>

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.370
<b>accepting his challenge?</b>

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.060
<b>As you wish.</b>

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:51.710
<b>This is your battle.</b>

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.260
<b>Where's your weapon?</b>

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:03.720
<b>Go borrow a sword or a spear from the Zhcted soldiers!</b>

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:06.810
<b>This is my weapon.</b>

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:07.980
<b>Cut the crap!</b>

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:10.860
<b>How can you duel with a bow?!</b>

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:13.650
<b>They're only good for surprise attacks. 
Completely useless against—</b>

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:14.360
<b>Why don't we put it to the test?</b>

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:14.990
<b>What?</b>

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.780
<b>You see? That's all a bow can do!</b>

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.080
<b>No matter how often you shoot, you won't hit!</b>

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.480
<b>Enough!</b>

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:39.590
<b>It's impossible to have a proper duel with you when you're good at nothing but the bow!</b>

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:43.850
<b>Time to lop off your head, and put an end to this!</b>

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:50.560
<b>Die, Vorn! Spineless coward!</b>

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:22.680
<b>That's... That's impossible!</b>

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:27.640
<b>Young Lord...</b>

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:32.100
<b>To repeatedly hit the same spot
on a moving opponent's shield...</b>

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:35.370
<b>He really is something else.</b>

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.070
<b>Help Lord Zion!</b>

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:47.370
<b>Protect Tigre!</b>

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.590
<b>That could've gone both ways.</b>

00:19:58.380 --> 00:19:59.800
<b>But it didn't.</b>

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:16.820
<b>My father will crush you, 
together with your precious Alsace!</b>

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.860
<b>As if I'd die out here!</b>

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:25.870
<b>My wind blades cannot reach him from this distance.</b>

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:33.710
<b><i>Will he get away after all he's done?</i></b>

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:37.710
<b><i>Are we letting him escape?</i></b>

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.470
<b>Shoot the dragon.</b>

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.930
<b>I'll repeat myself.</b>

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.140
<b>Shoot the dragon.</b>

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:55.770
<b>Was that... you...?</b>

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:16.420
<b>Are you lending him your strength?</b>

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:38.020
<b>Im-Impossible!</b>

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.500
<b>Tigrevurmud Vorn...</b>

00:21:54.760 --> 00:21:58.500
<b>has shot down Zion Thenardier!</b>

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:05.420
<b>With their commander, Zion, dead, the Thenardier soldiers lose their spirit and are easily routed.</b>

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:09.390
<b>And thus Alsace is safe once more.</b>

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:14.720
Episode 3

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:14.720
